{"unit_id":"fuyu-technology__dsh-box-ui#card-zh","repo":"fuyu-technology/dsh-box-ui","commit":"95fff5e81c54ce5f8ef7373628666dc98fb8fde0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-box-ui 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的需求留言箱面板，在设置页侧边导航加入「需求箱」，通过宿主 webServer 路由连接本机 box-server。面板可查看并筛选留言、统计不同状态和类型、修改回执、回复、删除、新建，也可按状态或全部清空。它适合在 DSH 设置中集中处理反馈与需求；使用前需运行本机 box-server，并配置需求箱目录和端口，令牌由宿主从本地文件读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:454-465","index.js:89-124","client.js:315-376"]}
{"unit_id":"fuyu-technology__dsh-box-ui#card-en","repo":"fuyu-technology/dsh-box-ui","commit":"95fff5e81c54ce5f8ef7373628666dc98fb8fde0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-box-ui adds a requirement inbox to DSH web settings, connected to a local box-server. Users can filter entries, update receipts, reply, delete or create items, and clear finished or all entries. A local service and token file are required; the host reads the token and forwards requests.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:454-465","index.js:89-124","client.js:315-376"]}
